---
pagination:
  data: labs
  size: 1
  alias: lab
permalink: "lab_{{ lab.numberStr }}.html"
layout: base.njk
tags: lab
eleventyComputed:
  title: "Lab {{ lab.numberStr }}: Building an LLM (5 pts.)"
icon: fa-book
navigation:
  - name: "Home"
    link: "index.html"
    icon: "fa-gavel"
---

{% set assignment_name = lab.assignmentName %}
{% set assignment_display = lab.assignmentDisplay %}
{% set assignment_resource = resources | findAssignmentResource(assignment_display, '') %}
{% set notebook_link = '' %}
{% if assignment_resource %}
    {% set notebook_link = assignment_resource.link %}
{% endif %}

<h2>Task 1: Notebook</h2>

<p>Copy the following notebook and answer the included questions using the method of your choosing:</p>

{% if notebook_link %}
<div class="alert alert-success">
<a href="{{ notebook_link }}">OPEN NOTEBOOK IN GOOGLE COLAB</a>
</div>
{% else %}
<div class="alert alert-warning">
<p>Notebook link not yet available. Please check back later.</p>
</div>
{% endif %}

<p>For your convenience the notebook is displayed below as HTML but you will likely
find it easier to copy the notebook from the Google Colab link above.</p>

<div class="embed-responsive embed-responsive-4by3">
<iframe
    class="embed-responsive-item theme-notebook-frame"
    data-src-dark="https://williamtheisen.com/nd-cse-10124-assignments/labs/{{ assignment_name }}/{{ assignment_name }}-dark.html"
    data-src-light="https://williamtheisen.com/nd-cse-10124-assignments/labs/{{ assignment_name }}/{{ assignment_name }}-light.html"
    src="https://williamtheisen.com/nd-cse-10124-assignments/labs/{{ assignment_name }}/{{ assignment_name }}-dark.html"
    width="100%"
    height="800"></iframe>
</div>

<pre style="display: none;" id="dr-container" class="codehilite"><code id="dredd-response"></code></pre>

<h2>Task 2: Assignment Submission Instructions</h2>

<p>The final cell of the notebook will export and download a .html file of your
notebook. Upload this to canvas for the assignment.</p>
